1
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:45,640
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:46,920
[Episode 12]

3
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:47,410
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gujun]

5
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,900
What is this supposed to mean?

6
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,880
Let's end this.

7
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:05,519
Tinglan.

8
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,120
Can you tell me

9
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,450
how we got to this point?

10
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,980
Let's calm down and talk this out.

11
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,039
Part of this is my fault.

12
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,530
When Wen Jian showed up,

13
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,600
I wanted to hear your side,

14
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:28,000
but I was too afraid to ask.

15
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:29,680
But now,

16
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,850
after what happened today,

17
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,840
the answer no longer matters.

18
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,400
Zhuo Yu'an.

19
00:01:40,039 --> 00:01:40,920
I'm so tired.

20
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,000
Thank you.

21
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,000
Hey, Yu'an.

22
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,930
Are you still at the office?

23
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,329
Meet me downstairs.

24
00:02:18,670 --> 00:02:23,360
[Zhuoyuan Technology Group]

25
00:02:23,410 --> 00:02:29,570
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

26
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,200
When did you start

27
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,840
liking cute little charms?

28
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:57,770
What happened between you
and Shu Tinglan?

29
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,840
I don't know.

30
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,920
We haven't seen each other
in years.

31
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,440
In years?

32
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,250
You knew her before?

33
00:03:11,790 --> 00:03:12,720
Yeah.

34
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,200
We grew up as neighbors

35
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,240
and played together a lot.

36
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,640
but we weren't in the same class.

37
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:18,400
If we ever had any problems,

38
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,800
they were just little fights

39
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,120
between kids.

40
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,290
I don't even remember them.

41
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,840
Just little fights?

42
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,600
Would she really do that
in front of everyone?

43
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,240
She started it.

44
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,200
Go ask her.

45
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,640
Yu'an.

46
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,720
After all these years,

47
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:42,760
you still don't trust me?

48
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:46,920
Or do you trust Shu Tinglan

49
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,400
more than me now?

50
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,040
Shu Tinglan.

51
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,770
I don't know what to do with you.

52
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,800
Keep personal issues private.

53
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,640
Your reckless behavior

54
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,640
has hurt the firm's reputation.

55
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,040
I'm sorry, Xiao.

56
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,980
Apologizing to me won't help.

57
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,840
You need to apologize to Ms. Wen.

58
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,480
You know this project

59
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,800
is nearing the end.

60
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:09,240
We have to see it through.

61
00:05:10,010 --> 00:05:10,760
Here's what we'll do.

62
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:13,040
Zhou will join you on-site

63
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,800
so you don't lose control again

64
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,600
and hurt our firm's reputation.

65
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,040
Understood.

66
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,290
Thank you, Xiao.

67
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:23,920
Personal matters stay private.

68
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,770
Come with me to their office

69
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,440
and apologize to Ms. Wen
and Mr. Zhuo.

70
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:28,120
Xiao.

71
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,920
I can't explain everything,

72
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,770
but I know one thing.

73
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,960
Speaking for myself,

74
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,400
I did nothing wrong that day.

75
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,040
I can't apologize to her.

76
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,900
Did you hear anything I just said?

77
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:47,659
I'm not asking you to apologize
on a personal level.

78
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,400
I'm asking you, as a lawyer,

79
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,400
to apologize to Mr. Zhuo
and Ms. Wen.

80
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,400
Tinglan.

81
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,560
You can run from the problem.

82
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,000
But facing it and solving it

83
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,240
is how you'll truly grow.

84
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,100
Leave the project,

85
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,370
or apologize to Ms. Wen.

86
00:06:18,490 --> 00:06:19,720
You have one day.

87
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:21,190
It's your choice.

88
00:07:07,530 --> 00:07:08,320
Kitty.

89
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,200
It looks like

90
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,150
it'll need treatment for a while.

91
00:07:19,150 --> 00:07:20,680
If you decide to adopt it,

92
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,410
you'll need to cover the costs.

93
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,400
I haven't decided

94
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:26,200
whether to adopt it yet.

95
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:27,410
But I can cover

96
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,760
all its treatment costs

97
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,800
until you find it a good home.

98
00:07:30,970 --> 00:07:31,840
Sure.

99
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,100
We mainly take in

100
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:34,440
rescued animals here.

101
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,280
Donations from animal lovers

102
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,080
cover their food and treatment.

103
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:39,200
Until then,

104
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,950
the kitten can stay here with us.

105
00:07:40,950 --> 00:07:41,880
That's great.

106
00:07:42,230 --> 00:07:43,330
I'll pay the fees now.

107
00:07:43,330 --> 00:07:43,920
Okay.

108
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,720
Here you go.

109
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,440
Done.

110
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,720
You're all set, Ms. Shu.

111
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,600
We'll send you regular updates

112
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:52,130
on the kitten's condition.

113
00:07:52,750 --> 00:07:53,630
Please take good care of it.

114
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,560
You're welcome.

115
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:05,630
[Ding Ding Pet Hospital]

116
00:08:13,740 --> 00:08:19,060
[Ding Ding Pet Hospital]

117
00:08:24,470 --> 00:08:28,570
[Ding Ding Pet Hospital]

118
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:34,330
What brings you here?

119
00:08:34,330 --> 00:08:34,630
Hello.

120
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:36,630
How much are you donating this time?

121
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,510
What was that woman

122
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:39,650
doing here?

123
00:08:39,669 --> 00:08:40,440
Her?

124
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,000
She brought in a rescued kitten.

125
00:08:50,250 --> 00:08:51,680
Why? Do you know her?

126
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:55,040
Not really.

127
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,440
Oh.

128
00:09:03,350 --> 00:09:04,240
Mr. Zhuo.

129
00:09:03,710 --> 00:09:06,680
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

130
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,040
Ms. Wen.

131
00:09:05,150 --> 00:09:07,000
Tinglan knows she was wrong.

132
00:09:07,020 --> 00:09:08,920
We'll take full responsibility

133
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,640
for any harm this caused.

134
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:13,000
I hope you can forgive her.

135
00:09:22,690 --> 00:09:23,800
I'm sorry, Ms. Wen.

136
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:25,450
I lost control yesterday

137
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,680
and caused you trouble.

138
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,040
I sincerely apologize.

139
00:09:34,020 --> 00:09:35,460
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

140
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:38,680
Mr. Zhuo.

141
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:40,840
I'm sorry.

142
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,240
Shu Tinglan.

143
00:09:45,310 --> 00:09:47,370
You don't apologize without reason.

144
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:49,080
At least tell me why.

145
00:09:49,470 --> 00:09:51,320
Thank you for your concern, Mr. Zhuo.

146
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,980
This is between Ms. Wen and me.

147
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,160
Fine.

148
00:09:59,530 --> 00:10:00,840
Some private matter.

149
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:10,280
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

150
00:10:11,310 --> 00:10:13,120
So you swallow your pride

151
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:14,800
and play the long game.

152
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:16,320
Shu Tinglan.

153
00:10:17,530 --> 00:10:19,460
You're nothing like you used to be.

154
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,760
I just don't think

155
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:24,880
someone who doesn't matter

156
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,160
is worth losing control over

157
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,040
or letting it affect my work.

158
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,560
I'll take that

159
00:10:29,820 --> 00:10:32,110
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

160
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,430
as a compliment, Ms. Wen.

161
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:33,810
Moving forward,

162
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:39,370
I look forward to working with you.

163
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:43,830
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

164
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:51,000
[In Loving Memory]

165
00:10:50,290 --> 00:10:51,440
Aren't they the mother and daughter

166
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,240
who used to visit the Shu family?

167
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:54,320
Yeah.

168
00:10:54,610 --> 00:10:56,470
- Why are they here?
- Shu Minghai.

169
00:10:56,860 --> 00:10:58,840
I brought your daughter to see you.

170
00:10:58,840 --> 00:10:59,800
Dad.

171
00:11:00,250 --> 00:11:01,250
Dad.

172
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,720
Dad.

173
00:11:04,950 --> 00:11:05,880
Wen Lan.

174
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:08,130
What is this supposed to mean?

175
00:11:10,450 --> 00:11:11,480
All these years,

176
00:11:13,470 --> 00:11:15,600
we never tried to take anything.

177
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:17,520
I never told you

178
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,800
that Wen Jian

179
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:23,480
is Shu Minghai's biological daughter.

180
00:11:24,970 --> 00:11:27,120
What are you talking about?

181
00:11:27,140 --> 00:11:28,540
This is my dad's funeral.

182
00:11:34,370 --> 00:11:35,830
This is the DNA test report

183
00:11:36,340 --> 00:11:38,600
for Shu Minghai and Wen Jian.

184
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:41,790
[DNA Paternity Test Report]

185
00:11:48,090 --> 00:11:50,600
[In Loving Memory]

186
00:11:50,930 --> 00:11:51,590
Mom.

187
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:52,820
Don't listen to them.

188
00:11:53,050 --> 00:11:54,920
Shu Minghai left

189
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:57,280
all his assets

190
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,440
and his insurance payout

191
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:03,280
to Wen Jian.

192
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,220
Mom.

193
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,600
Mom!

194
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:12,440
Mom.

195
00:12:13,730 --> 00:12:14,520
All these years,

196
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:17,400
Jian could only call him Dad
when no one was around.

197
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:17,840
Dad.

198
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,080
Dad!

199
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:20,120
Dad.

200
00:12:22,540 --> 00:12:23,880
Now that he's gone,

201
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,400
just one last time,

202
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:26,800
one last time,

203
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:30,640
I just want her to call him Dad
in front of everyone.

204
00:12:31,530 --> 00:12:32,680
Dad!
